  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "5.0\n- Update MeteoSwiss API endpoints from v2 to v3.\n- Add new warn type Drought to WarnType.\n\n4.1\n- Map the invalid data sentinel (32767) to null in CurrentWeather: properties Temperature and Icon are now nullable.\n- Add missing translations for HumidityRanges and PressureRanges.\n- Sync station measurement models with full API data.\n- Map missing SwissMetNet columns and SLF week snow measurements.\n- Add RegionId to Warning model.\n- Fix problem with SlfStationType serialization.\n\n4.0\n- Replace Newtonsoft.Json with System.Text.Json for JSON serialization.\n\n3.2\n- Add model for climate information (KlimaGraph) to WeatherInfo.\n\n3.1\n- Extend models Forecast and GraphDetail with new properties\n\n3.0\n- Add service to retrieve SwissMetNet weather stations\n- Add service to retrieve SLF weather stations\n- Add response caching\n- Add high-contrast svg icons\n- Add support for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection\n\n2.0\n- Replace Temperature type with UnitsNet Temperature\n\n1.3\n- Maintenance updates\n\n1.2\n- Maintenance updates\n\n1.1\n- Add new method GetForecastAsync\n- Handle properties WarnType and WarnLevel with custom types\n\n1.0\n- Initial release",
